      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would much rather use passwords or codewords instead of a number because let's say that you can buy 16 different items, now you need to asign a different number to each combination of items bought, however with pass/codewords it is completely changeable what it should be and how long it would be.",
      "viewerReactions": null
